[hrdoucet@watcgl.waterloo.edu (Heloise Doucet) writes:]
[] OK, I made it to level 50 - now what?
[] I've gone up a few levels trying to find the wizard - is that what I'm
[] supposed to do? Or, will the wizard find me?

well, the object of the game is to escape the dungeon with the
Amulet of Yendor.  it just so happens that the Wizard of Yendor
is usually watching over it.

you'll know when you get to the wizard's level and so will he ...

if at all possible, get the amulet without killing the wizard.
in any event, there are ways to keep the wizard in his place so
he won't constantly intervene when you least expect it.

the amulet has powerful magic (which should be played up more, IMO)
so don't be surprised if strange things happen while you're
carrying it.

